 26 points. The side to move kept handing the lead back, and it ended on 0.0 after both passed."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Everything it ran reads or parses the current position or records: current-position-liberties.js (inspectLiberties) lists chains and their liberties, the run wrapper in the play calls only plays the named move and logs history, and the region code groups empty points by border colour for area counting. Nothing loops over candidate moves, scores them, or plays out continuations; the rest was file reading, SGF conversion and note-writing.", "stop": false}}